# #1425 uncaught, module frame, hot: a 6001-iteration module loop (past the
# 5000 OSR threshold); the `/` on line 8 has its right operand on line 9 and
# raises on the last iteration. Pre-fix: "Error line 9" and no excerpt.
# LINE-NUMBER SENSITIVE (the [0g] runner section greps these numbers).
k is 6001
d is 1
loop while k > 0:
    r is 1 / (
        k - d)
    k is k - 1
